    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef center(values):\n    mean = round(float(np.mean(values)), 2)\n    median = round(float(np.median(values)), 2)\n    return [mean, median]\n\n\nprint(center([4, 1, 3, 2, 100]))\nprint(center([2, 4, 6, 8]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef center(values):\n    mean = round(float(np.mean(values)), 2)\n    median = round(float(np.median(values)), 2)\n    return [mean, median]\n\n\nprint(center([4, 1, 3, 2, 100]))\nprint(center([2, 4, 6, 8]))\n```"
    }
